@startuml

hide footbox

title US008 - To register a new city in the system

actor Administrator
participant ":System" as System

'Human Interactions between Administrator and System
Administrator -> System : **1** I want to register a new city in the system!
System --> Administrator : **2** What is the name of the city you wish to register and from which country is it?
Administrator -> System : **3** The city name is <name> and it's from <country>!
System --> Administrator : **4** <City> has been registered in the system!
@enduml